 76: ## 4. What is already correct (do not regress)
 77: 
 78: - PKCE S256 verification in `_handle_token` is implemented correctly.
 79: - Auth codes are single-use (`pop`).
 80: - Tool annotations correctly mark read vs. write vs. destructive operations.
 81: - The MCP tool surface itself does not construct shell commands or eval input.
 82: - `/favicon.ico` is special-cased so it doesn't 401 during the authorize page load — keep this.
